From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dcasati <dcasati@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:43:28 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] ath12k: WCN7850 bring-up on FreeBSD via LinuxKPI

Port of the Linux ath12k driver for the Qualcomm WCN7850 (PCIe, MHI),
drawing on OpenBSD qwz for the native QMI/MHI firmware boot path:

- Native QMI client and codec, MHI glue, WCN7850 CE/HAL register tables.
- LinuxKPI 802.11: WPA2 station port gating (M4 ACK, PTK/GTK, firmware
  authorize), strict self-managed regulatory with terminal TX revoke.
- LinuxKPI/regulatory/MHI tests.
- ATH12KHOST / ATH12KLAB kernel configs.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
